      "statusChangeNewStatus": "interested",
      "value": "Just fixed VRCUrl in 2021.3.2, build 1118. Arrays still have this issue - however, we won't be able to support OnVariableChange events for array in the short-term, so instead we'll make them never fire the OnVariableChange event in the next update.",
