  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-22T05:01:26.505Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you sync a vrcurl or an array, their respective variable Change events will activate every time there's a deserialization for non-owners. This will happen regardless of if sendChange is on or not, they will be considered Changed every time.\nThe attached picture is an example graph: Even though the SyncedInt is the only variable being changed, the SyncedURL and SyncedIntArray Change events will also activate for non-owners.",
